  "problem": "$\\,$ $P(a):$ $a\\in N$ and $a$ is even\n\nGiven that the above predicate is defined over the universal set $Q,$ which of the following statements are true?\n\nI. The truth set of $P(a)$ is $∅.$\n\nII. The truth set of $P(a)$ is $Q.$\n\nIII. $∃a\\in Q,\\,P(a).$",
